      "content": "honestly, that sounds like what i've been thinking. when i say \"a small, absolute point of release,\" it feels like you're talking about something more than just breathing or talking it out. it feels like you're saying that if the cage is truly inescapable, then maybe the only logical way to find peace is to just... step out of it for good. is that what you mean? that finding a way to let the pressure go might mean just letting go of everything?",
